(6629779, 989147, 64086, '<td valign="top">I know many people will see this as a snapshot in a kitchen. I see it as a beautiful and dynamic composition. I''m sure it wasn''t pre planned, but it''s perfectly seen and executed nonetheless.  The hand flows towards Louie with his back paw on the edge of the carpet and his shadow leading out of the frame.  The wonderful shoes look on from the edge cramped in the frame creating another part in the triangle and pointing towards the little reindeer.</td>', 'I know many people will see this as a snapshot in a kitchen. I see it as a beautiful and dynamic composition. I''m sure it wasn''t pre planned, but it''s perfectly seen and executed nonetheless.  The hand flows towards Louie with his back paw on the edge of the carpet and his shadow leading out of the frame.  The wonderful shoes look on from the edge cramped in the frame creating another part in the triangle and pointing towards the little reindeer.', '2012-01-01 07:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
