(6631575, 989481, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i>But... if you''d asked me to describe this image the words "Holiday Decorations" would not be there.   Just sayin''... (and not votin''... )    :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of course she was charming, the perfect hostess, but I saw her for one moment forget all that, remembering instead some past Christmas, perhaps the one for which she had bought those silly little lights. Her eye succumbed to a tear without ever letting it go. And then instantly she turned to me and asked to refill my wine.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo:But... if you''d asked me to describe this image the words "Holiday Decorations" would not be there.   Just sayin''... (and not votin''... )    :D   Of course she was charming, the perfect hostess, but I saw her for one moment forget all that, remembering instead some past Christmas, perhaps the one for which she had bought those silly little lights. Her eye succumbed to a tear without ever letting it go. And then instantly she turned to me and asked to refill my wine.', '2012-01-02 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
